-- The Groth16 rows (S8b 4d). The proofs and publics come from the golden
-- files in test/noir/ (cryptotool noir NAME test/noir/NAME); the elig and
-- elig2 data are in domain/domain.lang, where the examples see them. The first 3
-- rows are valid proofs (inr). The other rows must be inl: public 0 + 1,
-- public 0 + r (an alias of public 0), a short public list, A and C swapped,
-- and the elig proof under the outcome key.
def outcomePrfA : Pt1 := pt1 (fe 0x8ba7009cw 0x1f6c4f25w 0x599649eaw 0x167f8095w 0x9c0f9e16w 0xca2e8bb1w 0xf1729537w 0x18e34634w) (fe 0xb08a40eew 0x760f5d0ew 0x8a4fa75aw 0x30dfa815w 0xbf0b14b0w 0xa8208f6fw 0xe488a785w 0x0f8a84d2w)
